    <p style="margin:.35rem 0;font-size:.88rem;color:#334155">Base collaboration tiers only include app-to-app VoIP calls. Adding a real 10-digit PSTN phone number with domestic calling adds <strong>+$15–$17/seat on Microsoft Teams</strong> and <strong>+$10–$30/seat on Google Voice</strong>—whereas <strong>Webex Suite ($22.50)</strong> and <strong>Zoom Business Plus ($22.49)</strong> bundle phone + meetings together.</p>
